<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "keep a wiki warm on the worn face's keep list"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.wiki.keeps"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.wiki.keeps"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.wiki.keeps"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.wiki.keeps ~ keep a wiki warm

`slug` names the wiki; a full keep budget refuses by name and drops no keep.

The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list. The MCP seat runs this act in its own process: the vessel's `call` binds the params against this carrier's live `#/takes` and answers `handler/seat` with the bound params, and the seat runs them (`act(address="lar:///engine.wiki.keeps", args={…})`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/word needs/required seat/1 as/<slug> ~ the wiki by slug`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel verbs the seat's handler reaches check the face's cap and the asker's hand themselves; a hand act refuses a seat by its own code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli · mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki keep

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares wiki keep]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! act lar:///engine.wiki.keeps

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`handler/seat spells/[[act lar:///engine.wiki.keeps]] ~ the seat runs it in its own process`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

